                                    {
                                      "tag": "article",
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h1",
                                          "text": "Self-serve flight-change for loyalty guests",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "Problem",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "text": "Loyalty-tier guests currently must call the concierge desk to change a flight inside the ±48h departure window. This bottlenecks the desk during weather events ",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "Goals",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "ul",
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Reduce desk volume for in-window changes by **60%** in Q3.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Maintain **<1.5s** rebook search latency at p95.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Keep guest-facing failure rate **under 0.5%**.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "No regression to existing supplier-side rebook contracts.",
                                              "children": []
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "Non-goals",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "ul",
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "New-bookings flow (out of scope).",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Multi-leg itineraries with >2 connecting flights.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Loyalty-tier upgrades from inside the change flow.",
                                              "children": []
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "User stories",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "text": "1. As a Gold-tier guest, I can open my itinerary and tap \"Change flight\" to see eligible alternatives. 2. As a Platinum-tier guest, I can change a flight for my",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "Acceptance criteria",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "ul",
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "[ ] Eligibility check runs in <200ms p95 against rebook-rules service.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "[ ] Alternatives list is sorted by fare-difference, then departure delta.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "[ ] Confirmation receipt is delivered via guest-app push **and** email within 30s.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "[ ] Failed transactions roll back the itinerary-service write atomically.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "[ ] Audit event is written to loyalty-ledger for every successful change.",
                                              "children": []
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "Dependencies",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "text": "| System | Owner | Contract | |---------------------|----------------|-----------------| | rebook-rules svc | @booking-team | gRPC v3 | | itinerary-service | @o",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "Out of scope clarifications needed",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "text": "> The following ambiguities will be resolved in the next step.",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "ul",
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Refund handling when new fare is lower",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Eligibility for award-ticket bookings",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Behavior when companion-traveler bookings span tiers",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Whether change quotas reset on cancel-and-rebook",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Offline / poor-connection retry policy",
                                              "children": []
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "Open risks",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "ul",
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Supplier API throttling during weather events could push us over the latency budget. We may need to pre-warm caches.",
                                              "children": []
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tag": "li",
                                              "text": "Loyalty-ledger throughput has not been load-tested above 80 events/sec; in-window change spikes could exceed that.",
                                              "children": []
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "h2",
                                          "text": "Notes",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "text": "This spec was drafted by Copilot CLI from the provided prompt and grounded against existing repo conventions found in `concierge-api` and `booking-engine`. See ",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "text": "---",
                                          "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "text": "*End of spec — scroll-through complete unlocks the Clarify step.*",
                                          "children": []
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
